# This repo is authored on Windows and run on a Linux HPC. Force LF in the
# working tree: bin/ scripts carry a shebang, and CRLF there produces
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env python3^M" on the cluster.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Reference outputs are compared byte-for-byte; never let git rewrite them.
tests/golden/** -text
tests/fixtures/** -text
